        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "Pioneer set a new low for event count this week, with only two events firing. Over the past four weeks, it has had just 15 events in total, roughly what Modern gets in a single week. It certainly lives up to its reputation as the least popular format. With only two small events, the data is thin: a single appearance is enough to reach a 3% share of high-performing decklists, and week-to-week swings can be large. One week's results therefore tell us very little.",
          "zh": "本周先驱刷新比赛数量新低，只开起来两场。最近4周先驱合计比赛数量为15场，基本是摩登一周的数量。不愧为是人气最低赛制。两场小规模比赛的数据参考性比较小，出现一次就会达到3%高分占比，波动也比较大，单周数据基本没什么参考意义。"
        }
      }
